OL,3,GNEWSASearch for motorist after man dies
OL,4,Ain hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was killed when he was hit by a
OL,7,Fcar which was then driven away.
OL,9,FThe 68-year-old was hit by a
OL,10,Fdark-coloured vehicle on Stratford
OL,11,FRoad, in Hall Green, Birmingham, on
OL,12,FThursday evening, police said.
OL,14,FParamedics were unable to help the man,
OL,15,Fwho was found in critical condition,
OL,16,Fand he died at the scene.
OL,18,FAn investigation has been carried out
OL,19,Fovernight to try and identify the car
OL,20,Fand driver involved. A stretch of the
OL,21,Froad was closed but has since reopened.
